            "line_number": 1,
            "modified_line": "public void tryFoldComparison(Node comparison) {\n Node left = comparison.getFirstChild();\n Node right = comparison.getLastChild();\n\n if (left.isNull() || right.isNull()) {\n return;\n }\n\n if (!left.isString() || !right.isString()) {\n return;\n }\n\n String leftValue = left.getString();\n String rightValue = right.getString();\n\n if (comparison.getToken() == Token.SHEQ\n && (leftValue.equals(\"null\") || rightValue.equals(\"null\"))) {\n comparison.replaceWith(IR.trueNode(comparison));\n } else if (comparison.getToken() == Token.SHNE\n && (leftValue.equals(\"null\") || rightValue.equals(\"null\"))) {\n comparison.replaceWith(IR.falseNode(comparison));\n }\n}"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
